One Docker image (Dockerfile):
python:3.12-slim-bookworm, app, migrations, tools, tests, scripts;
build argument GIT_SHA becomes APP_VERSION (/healthz version)

process api
python -m app.runtime api (uvicorn, port 8000);
also serves /ui/; Fly health check GET /livez

chain-head.yml (cron 17 3 * * *, or by hand)
tools/verify_ledger.py --anchor from main;
scheduled only once on main
